# Enterprise Automation Guardrails (v2)

Pacote: **Enterprise Automation Rules v2 — RSV360**. Operação **ampla, robusta, enterprise e multidisciplinar** com **autonomia controlada por guardrails** — nunca irrestrita.

Fase atual: `.cursor/automations/phase-config.json` (`rulesVersion: v2`).

## Never allowed (all phases)

- Auto-merge pull requests
- Deploy to any environment
- Edit `.env`, credentials, secrets, private keys, or payment/cloud access files
- Delete or truncate production data
- Disable security, auth, authorization or validation to pass tests
- Large refactors without explicit human approval
- Edit protected enterprise files without owner token (`ALTERAR_ENTERPRISE_RULES_V2`)

## Phase behavior

| Phase | PRs | Auto-merge | Trigger |
|-------|-----|------------|---------|
| `initial` | Report only | Never | Daily |
| `intermediate` | Small safe fixes + tests | Never | Push to `develop` |
| `production` | High-confidence only + LGPD/security/arch review | Never | `main`/`develop` + PRs |

## PR eligibility

Open PR only when ALL true: concrete bug, minimal fix, lint/test/build pass, phase allows PR, no secrets/migrations/auth bypass, human review required.

## Validation

`npm run lint` · `npm run test` · `npm run build` · `npm run type-check`

## Memory

Track open findings in `MEMORIES.md` only. Do not duplicate items with open PRs.
